  "description": "Bloodshed and chaos...\n\nA lawless era of mountains and seas of corpses. The Geumganggong (Vajra Art) arrived just in time. Only then did peace return to the martial arts world... However, the bloodthirsty demons revealed their true colors once again. The Nine-Eight Masters, who reinterpreted the Geumganggong and perfected their dream of creating the Bloodwater Demonic Art, revealed their true colors. Who will save the blood-soaked martial arts world?\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
